  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Evaluation Management Unit for Low Carbon Development Initiative Phase 2 (LCDI2)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The primary purpose of the EMU contract is to maximise the LCDI 2 programme&#x2019;s efficiency, effectiveness, impact, and sustainability. The secondary purpose is to strengthen the FCDO &#x2013; and global - evidence base on how to foster green, resilient economic growth.The EMU is responsible for strengthening the monitoring framework of the LCDI Phase 2 Supplier, undertaking independent evaluations, and facilitating learning and knowledge dissemination.The scope of the EMU contract includes a) support to MEL system, b) support to monitoring framework, c) support to ICF KPIs, d) deliver a process evaluation and an impact evaluation, e) develop learning and knowledge dissemination strategy and f) produce learning materials.</narrative>
  </description>
